# Store every text file with LF in the repository and check it out with LF on
# every platform, `core.autocrlf` notwithstanding. The scanners under
# scripts/verify/ read source files line by line; a CRLF working tree changes
# what they see, and a checkout-dependent verdict from a check that gates
# commits is worse than no check at all. Shell scripts under scripts/ also
# require LF to be executable at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never line-ending converted or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webm binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
